Astir
=====

See README.md for what this is and what it does, and INSTALL.md for how to
build and install it.

Astir is a fork of Xastir (https://xastir.org) with a GTK4 front end.  It is a
separate program, not a newer version; the two install and run side by side and
share no files.  FORK.md explains the split.

This file exists because the build tooling expects a plain-text README.  It is
not maintained separately -- read README.md.
